{%- comment -%}
  Subscription minimum rule: the single place it is decided. Outputs one word.

    ok         checkout allowed
    below-min  the cart is under the minimum
    sub-short  the cart holds a subscription that would renew under the minimum

  The rule (Ryan, 2026-10-08): every order is at least $125, and a subscription must
  renew at $125 or more on its own. One-time add-ons can ride on a $125+ subscription,
  but they cannot carry a small one. Mirrors the Build a Box test (sections/build-a-box.liquid).

  Use with capture, so the drawer and the cart page share one answer:
    {%- capture plan_state -%}{%- render 'cart-plan-state' -%}{%- endcapture -%}

  The minimum is the existing theme setting settings.threshold_amount (Theme settings >
  Minimum Order Message, default 125), so there is one number to change. Gift-card carts
  are exempt from the order minimum, matching snippets/free-shipping-bar.liquid. The
  subscription total uses line prices after discounts, which is what a renewal charges.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign plan_min = settings.threshold_amount | default: '125' | strip | times: 100
  assign sub_total = 0
  assign has_gift_card = false
  assign gift_wrap_id = blank
  if linklists.gift-wrapping.links != blank and linklists.gift-wrapping.links.first.type == 'product_link'
    assign gift_wrap_id = linklists.gift-wrapping.links.first.object.variants.first.id
  endif

  for item in cart.items
    if gift_wrap_id != blank and item.variant_id == gift_wrap_id
      continue
    endif
    if item.product.type == 'Gift Cards'
      assign has_gift_card = true
    endif
    if item.selling_plan_allocation
      assign sub_total = sub_total | plus: item.final_line_price
    endif
  endfor

  # Same order total the existing minimum message uses: cart total less gift wrap.
  assign cart_total = cart.total_price
  for item in cart.items
    if gift_wrap_id != blank and item.variant_id == gift_wrap_id
      assign cart_total = cart_total | minus: item.final_line_price
    endif
  endfor

  if cart.item_count == 0
    echo 'ok'
  elsif sub_total > 0 and sub_total < plan_min
    echo 'sub-short'
  elsif cart_total < plan_min and has_gift_card == false
    echo 'below-min'
  else
    echo 'ok'
  endif
-%}
